  To add a post, drop a markdown file into src/content/blog/ with this frontmatter:

  ---
  title: "Post title"
  description: "Optional summary"   # shown on the listing page
  pubDate: 2026-05-07
  updatedDate: 2026-05-08           # optional
  draft: false                      # optional; hides post in production builds
  tags: ["astro", "meta"]           # optional
  ---

  The filename becomes the URL slug (my-post.md → /blog/my-post/). Subdirectories are supported too.
